  "description": "Rose gold and old rose pink flower bouquets collection. Watercolour pre-made wedding invitation templates. Hand drawn floral home decorations comes with 10 design bouquets. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.\nAll vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.\nWith this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:\n10 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)\n10 JPG files\n10 SVG files\n1 Ai file (vector format)\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements\n1 PDF file\n1 DXF file\nFiles are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Rose gold and old rose pink flower bouquets collection. Watercolour pre-made wedding invitation templates. Hand drawn floral home decorations comes with 10 design bouquets. You can use them to dress up your Party, invitations, clothing’s, cards, stickers, web design, floral wall decor, wedding decor, create gift, make tumbler or mug waterslide transfer, sublimation and scrapbooking project.</p>\n<p>All vector objects can be resized without any quality loss, colors can be changed.</p>\n<p>With this purchase you will receive a package that contains the following files:</p>\n<p>10 PNG image in high-resolution with transparent, invisible backgrounds. You can place the individual clip art on any color or background you like. (promotion materials, T shirt…)<br>\n10 JPG files<br>\n10 SVG files<br>\n1 Ai file (vector format)<br>\n1 Corel Draw compatible EPS file<br>\n1 Photoshop file with layered elements<br>\n1 PDF file<br>\n1 DXF file</p>\n<p>Files are compatible for use with a variety of image editing, crafting programs.</p>",
